GET http://localhost:8000/v1/auth/invalid-route-xyz
Accept: application/json

### Test 2: Middleware Reject Missing Token
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/auth/sync
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "phone": "+919999999999"
}

### Test 3: Middleware Reject Expired/Malformed Token
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/auth/sync
Authorization: Bearer bad_token_strings_go_here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "phone": "+919999999999"
}

